Japie:

IIRC the "NoName" is not a 'Half Flash' system, so SRM *should* be 
already be on the system.
When the system initially boots it boots to the ARC console and displays 
a blue screen.  Somewhere in the bowels of the ARC console is an option 
to 'Boot to Unix'.  Select this and reboot.
*IF* SRM is there, it should boot.
Check the OpenVMS FAQ for more details on the Noname and SRM.

TomC

